                                                "sense_id": "1a128d3c-4359-3d09-96c8-8d8effe4524b",
                                                "text": "When Christmas Day falls upon a Saturday (as it did in 1736,) the Collect, Epistle and Gospel for St. Stephen's Day follows of Course, and no Notice is taken of the Sunday after Christmas Day"
